        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"from\": \"Eki <hello@eki-marketplace.com>\", \"to\": [\"{{ $json.email }}\"], \"subject\": \"Quick question (takes 30 seconds) 🙏\", \"html\": \"<div style=\\\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\\\">\\n<h2>Hey {{ $json.name }},</h2>\\n<p>You've been using <strong>Eki</strong> for a week now! 🎉</p>\\n<p>We'd love your honest feedback — it helps us build a better product for you.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"[FEEDBACK_FORM_LINK]?email={{ $json.email }}&name={{ $json.name }}\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #6C63FF; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px;\\\">Share Your Feedback 💬</a>\\n</div>\\n<p>It takes less than <strong>30 seconds</strong>.</p>\\n<p>As a thank you, you'll get <strong>exclusive marketplace premium status</strong>.</p>\\n<p>Your opinion truly matters to us.</p>\\n<p>With gratitude,<br>The Eki Team</p>\\n</div>\"}"
      },
