    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔧 Feedback Collection Setup\n\n### This workflow has TWO trigger flows:\n\n**Flow A — Send Feedback Requests (Scheduled)**\n- Runs daily at 11:00 AM (Europe/Rome)\n- Finds users who signed up ~7 days ago\n- Sends feedback request email with form link\n\n**Flow B — Process Feedback (Webhook)**\n- Receives feedback submissions via POST webhook\n- Routes by rating: positive (4-5), neutral (3), negative (1-2)\n\n### Webhook URL\n`POST https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/webhook/collect-feedback`\n\n### Expected POST Body\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"rating\": 4,\n  \"comments\": \"Great product!\",\n  \"would_recommend\": true\n}\n```\n\n### Form Integration\n- **Typeform**: Set up a webhook integration pointing to the collect-feedback URL\n- **Tally**: Use Tally's webhook feature\n- **Google Forms**: Use Google Apps Script to POST to the webhook\n\n### Google Sheet — \"Feedback\" columns:\n- `email`, `rating`, `comments`, `would_recommend`, `timestamp`, `rating_category`\n\n### Credentials Required\n1. **Google Sheets OAuth**\n2. **WhatsApp API Key** (for sending emails)\n3. **Telegram Bot API** (for low-rating alerts)\n\n### Replace Placeholders\n- `Eki` — your app name\n- `[FEEDBACK_FORM_LINK]` — your Typeform/Tally/Google Form URL\n- `marketplace premium status / verification fee discount` — what users get for giving feedback",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 660
      },
